{"speciesId":10,"names":{"fr":"Chenipan","es":"Caterpie","en":"Caterpie","ja":"キャタピー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Its short feet are tipped with suction pads that enable it to tirelessly climb slopes and walls."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Its short feet are tipped with suction pads that enable it to tirelessly climb slopes and walls."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"If you touch the feeler on top of its head, it will release a horrible stink to protect itself."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"For protection, it releases a horri­ ble stench from the antenna on its head to drive away enemies."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Its feet have suction cups designed to stick to any surface. It tenaciously climbs trees to forage."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It crawls into foliage where it camouflages itself among leaves that are the same color as its body."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"CATERPIE has a voracious appetite. It can devour leaves bigger than its body right before your eyes. From its antenna, this POKéMON releases a terrifically strong odor."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"CATERPIE has a voracious appetite. It can devour leaves bigger than its body right before your eyes. From its antenna, this POKéMON releases a terrifically strong odor."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its voracious appetite compels it to devour leaves bigger than itself without hesitation. It releases a terribly strong odor from its antennae."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is covered with a green skin. When it grows, it sheds the skin, covers itself with silk, and becomes a cocoon."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its short feet are tipped with suction pads that enable it to tirelessly climb slopes and walls."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"For protection, it releases a horrible stench from the antennae on its head to drive away enemies."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its feet have suction cups designed to stick to any surface. It tenaciously climbs trees to forage."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses antennes rouges libèrent une puanteur qui repousse l’ennemi. Il grandit par mues régulières."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses antennes rouges libèrent une puanteur qui repousse l’ennemi. Il grandit par mues régulières."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Pour se protéger, il émet un gaz puant par ses antennes, qui fait fuir ses ennemis audacieux."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Para protegerse despide un hedor horrible de sus antenas, con el que repele a sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"For protection, it releases a horrible stench from the antennae on its head to drive away enemies."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"頭の 触覚から 強烈な においを 出して 敵を 追い払い 身を守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses pattes ont des ventouses lui permettant de grimper sur toute surface, notamment les arbres."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sus patas tienen ventosas con las que se adhiere a cualquier sitio. Escala árboles buscando forraje."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its feet have suction cups designed to stick to any surface. It tenaciously climbs trees to forage."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"足の 先は どんなところにも 吸いつく 吸盤。必死に 木登りをして 葉っぱを 食べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Chenipan a un appétit d’ogre. Il peut engloutir des feuilles plus grosses que lui. Les antennes de ce Pokémon dégagent une odeur particulièrement entêtante."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Caterpie tiene un apetito voraz. Es capaz de devorar hojas que superen su tamaño en un abrir y cerrar de ojos. Atención a la antena que tiene: libera un hedor realmente fuerte."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Caterpie has a voracious appetite. It can devour leaves bigger than its body right before your eyes. From its antenna, this Pokémon releases a terrifically strong odor."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体 よりも 大きな 葉っぱを みるみる 食べつくして しまうほどの 食欲を もつ。 触角から 強烈な 臭いを 出すぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Chenipan a un appétit d’ogre. Il peut engloutir des feuilles plus grosses que lui. Les antennes de ce Pokémon dégagent une odeur particulièrement entêtante."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Caterpie tiene un apetito voraz. Es capaz de devorar hojas que superen su tamaño en un abrir y cerrar de ojos. Atención a la antena que tiene: libera un hedor realmente fuerte."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Caterpie has a voracious appetite. It can devour leaves bigger than its body right before your eyes. From its antenna, this Pokémon releases a terrifically strong odor."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体 よりも 大きな 葉っぱを みるみる 食べつくして しまうほどの 食欲を もつ。 触角から 強烈な 臭いを 出すぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Lorsqu’il est attaqué par un Pokémon Vol, il utilise ses antennes pour dégager une odeur nauséabonde, mais cela le sauve rarement."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"A menudo resulta presa de Pokémon pájaro, frente a los que su única defensa es el hedor repulsivo que libera por su antena."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"When attacked by bird Pokémon, it resists by releasing a terrifically strong odor from its antennae, but it often becomes their prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"とりポケモンに 襲われると ツノから 臭いを だして 抵抗 するが 餌食に なることも 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Un Pokémon facile à attraper et qui croît rapidement. C’est l’un des partenaires privilégiés des Dresseurs débutants."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Se desarrolla rápidamente y es fácil de atrapar. Es el compañero ideal para Entrenadores menos experimentados."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It’s easy to catch, and it grows quickly, making it one of the top recommendations for novice Pokémon Trainers."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"捕まえやすく 成長も 早い。 新米トレーナーの パートナーに おススメの ポケモンの 一匹。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"C’est peut-être parce qu’il a envie de grandir le plus vite possible qu’il est si vorace. Il engloutit une centaine de feuilles par jour."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Muestra un apetito voraz, debido quizás a sus ganas de acelerar su desarrollo. Puede llegar a devorar un centenar de hojas al día."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Perhaps because it would like to grow up quickly, it has a voracious appetite, eating a hundred leaves a day."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"早く 成長 したいのか 食欲旺盛で １日に １００枚の 葉っぱを 食らう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Son corps est mou et sans force. La nature semble l’avoir destiné à servir de proie aux autres Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Su cuerpo es blando y carente de fuerza. Parece que la naturaleza lo hubiera destinado a servir de sustento a otros Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its body is soft and weak. In nature, its perpetual fate is to be seen by others as food."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"身体は 柔らかく 力もない。 自然界では 常に エサとして 狙われ 続ける 運命。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Quand on touche l’appendice sur son front, il sécrète une odeur nauséabonde pour se protéger."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Cuando le tocan la antena roja que tiene en la frente, se defiende desprendiendo un hedor nauseabundo."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"If you touch the feeler on top of its head, it will release a horrible stink to protect itself."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"頭の 先にある 触角に ふれると 強烈な においを 出して 身を 守ろうとする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Quand on touche l’appendice sur son front, il sécrète une odeur nauséabonde pour se protéger."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Cuando le tocan la antena roja que tiene en la frente, se defiende desprendiendo un hedor nauseabundo."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"If you touch the feeler on top of its head, it will release a horrible stink to protect itself."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"頭の 先にある 触角に ふれると 強烈な においを 出して 身を 守ろうとする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Pour se protéger, il émet par ses antennes une odeur nauséabonde qui fait fuir ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Para protegerse, despide un hedor horrible por las antenas con el que repele a sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"For protection, it releases a horrible stench from the antenna on its head to drive away enemies."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"頭の 触角から 強烈な においを だして 敵を 追いはらい 身を守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ses petites pattes munies de ventouse